    "description": {
      "content": "The Zesty.io Accounts API is used to manage users, roles, instances, teams, tokens, ecosystems, webhooks, and apps. It provides administrative control over the organizational structure of a Zesty.io account. All endpoints require authentication via a session token obtained from the Auth API.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Zesty.io",
